      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA CUKAI KEUNTUNGAN HARTA TANAH 1976 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bab ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2025. Pindaan seksyen 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 3—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “jumlah”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan menggantikan perkataan “gains” dengan perkataan “gain”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan menggantikan perkataan “assets” dengan perkataan “asset”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(2 A) Bagi maksud Akta ini, keuntungan yang boleh dikenakan cukai yang terakru atas pelupusan aset yang boleh dikenakan cukai bagi sesuatu tahun taksiran hendaklah— (a) ditentukan mengikut setiap pelupusan secara berasingan; dan (b) dikira sebagai suatu keuntungan yang boleh dikenakan cukai berasingan daripada setiap pelupusan aset yang boleh dikenakan cukai bagi tahun taksiran itu.”. Pindaan seksyen 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 7(4) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (a) dengan perenggan yang berikut: “(a) ada kerugian yang boleh dibenarkan mengenai sesuatu pelupusan, kerugian yang boleh dibenarkan itu hendaklah hanya dibenarkan sebagai suatu potongan untuk mengurangkan keuntungan yang boleh dikenakan cukai bagi seseorang dalam pelupusan aset yang boleh dikenakan cukai yang berikutnya dalam tahun taksiran yang sama yang pelupusan itu telah dibuat; dan”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “jumlah” di mana-mana jua terdapat; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_20__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “yang baginya ada jumlah keuntungan yang boleh dikenakan cukai” perkataan “daripada pelupusan aset yang boleh dikenakan cukai yang lebih awal”. Pindaan seksyen 11"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 11 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “jumlah amaun keuntungannya yang boleh dikenakan cukai” dengan perkataan “amaun keuntungannya yang boleh dikenakan cukai yang terakru atas setiap pelupusan aset yang boleh dikenakan cukai”. Pindaan seksyen 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 21 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1A)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “atau cukai tambahan”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “enam puluh hari” dengan perkataan “sembilan puluh hari”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “atau taksiran tambahan”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_III__cl_22",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (4) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) Tertakluk kepada subseksyen (3), jika apa-apa cukai yang genap masanya dan kena dibayar apabila disampaikan suatu notis mengikut subseksyen (1) atau (2) tidak dibayar dalam tempoh tiga puluh hari selepas disampaikan notis itu (atau dalam tempoh yang lebih lama sebagaimana yang dibenarkan oleh Ketua Pengarah) atau jika apa-apa cukai yang genap masanya dan kena dibayar di bawah subseksyen (1A) tidak dibayar dalam tempoh sembilan puluh hari dari tarikh pelupusan, maka sekian banyak daripada cukai yang tidak dibayar itu apabila tamat tempoh tiga puluh hari itu atau tempoh yang lebih lama itu, atau apabila tamat tempoh sembilan puluh hari itu, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan, hendaklah, tanpa apa-apa notis selanjutnya disampaikan kepadanya, dinaikkan sebanyak jumlah yang sama dengan sepuluh peratus daripada cukai yang tidak dibayar sedemikian, dan jumlah wang itu boleh dituntut seolah-olah cukai itu ialah cukai yang genap masanya dan kena dibayar di bawah Akta ini: Dengan syarat bahawa— (a) jika cukai yang kena dibayar itu dikurangkan dalam rayuan atau selainnya, jumlah wang telah dibayar atau yang kena dibayar sebagai kenaikan itu hendaklah dikurangkan mengikut kadarnya; dan (b) Ketua Pengarah boleh, menurut budi bicaranya, bagi apa-apa sebab yang baik yang diberi, meremit kesemua atau apa-apa bahagian daripada apa-apa kenaikan dalam cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah subseksyen ini.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan sekyen 46B dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Deduction for individual on interest expended 46b. (1) Subject to this section, in the case of an individual who is a citizen and resident for the basis year for the relevant year, there shall be allowed for that relevant year personal deduction in respect of interest expended in that basis year by the individual to finance the purchase of a residential property: Provided that— (a) the residential property is the first residential property purchased by the individual to be occupied as his place of residence and limited to only one unit; (b) the Sale and Purchase Agreement for the purchase is executed on or after 1 January 2025 but not later than 31 December 2027; and (c) the individual shall not derive any income in respect of that residential property. (2) Subject to subsection (3)— (a) there shall be allowed to that individual a deduction of a maximum amount of— (i) seven thousand ringgit, in relation to a residential property where the purchase price is not more than five hundred thousand ringgit; or (ii) five thousand ringgit, in relation to a residential property where the purchase price is more than five hundred thousand ringgit but not more than seven hundred and fifty thousand ringgit; and (b) the deduction under paragraph (2)(a) shall be for each basis year for a year of assessment for a period of three consecutive basis years beginning from the basis year in which the interest referred to in subsection (1) is first expended by that individual. (3) Where— (a) two or more individuals are each entitled to claim deduction for the relevant year under this section for interest expended in respect of the same residential property; and (b) the total amount of interest expended by those individuals in the basis year for that relevant year exceed the amount of deduction allowable for that relevant year under subsection (2), there shall be allowed to each of those individuals for that relevant year an amount to be determined in accordance with the following formula: B A X C where A is the total amount of deduction allowed under subsection (2) for that relevant year; B is the total interest expended in the basis year for that relevant year by that individual; and C is the total interest expended in the basis year for that relevant year by all such individuals. (4) For the purposes of subsection (1), any amount expended by the wife or the husband in the relevant year— (a) where subsection 45(2) applies, shall be deemed to have been expended by the husband of the wife who elects or by the wife of the husband who elects, as the case may be; or (b) where the wife or the husband has no total income, shall be deemed to have been expended by the husband of that wife or the wife of that husband, as the case may be: Provided that where paragraph 45(2)(b) applies or where the husband has no total income, any amount expended by the husband shall be deemed to have been expended by the wife who has been allowed a deduction under section 45A. (5) For the purposes of this section, “residential property” means a house, condominium unit, apartment or flat which is built as a dwelling house.”. Pindaan seksyen 47"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
