      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 48(2)(b) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “six thousand ringgit” dengan perkataan “eight thousand ringgit”. Pindaan seksyen 49"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 49(1B) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “three thousand ringgit” di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan “four thousand ringgit”. Pindaan seksyen 107c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 107c(8) Akta ibu dipinda dalam proviso dengan menggantikan perkataan “ninth month” dengan perkataan “eleventh month”. Pindaan seksyen 108"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 108 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula seksyen sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1); dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula itu subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) Where a dividend is paid, credited or distributed, whether in monetary form or otherwise, by a company to any of its shareholders which is an individual, either through direct shareholding or a nominee, and the dividend is deemed by virtue of section 14 to be derived from Malaysia, the company shall, upon paying, crediting or distributing the dividend, furnish the shareholders with a certificate setting forth in respect of the dividend— (a) the gross amount; and (b) the amount paid or credited or where the dividend consists of property other than money, the amount of the market value of that property at the time of the distribution of the dividend.”. Pindaan Jadual 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual 1 kepada Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas Bahagian XXI bahagian yang berikut: “PART XXII 1. Notwithstanding Part I, income tax shall be charged upon the income of an individual which consists of dividend paid, credited or distributed, whether in monetary form or otherwise, by a company, and the dividend is deemed by virtue of section 14 to be derived from Malaysia, in excess of one hundred thousand ringgit at the rate of 2 per cent on every ringgit of the chargeable income in respect of such dividend. 2. In this Part, where the individual has income from a source other than dividend referred to in paragraph 1, the chargeable income of the individual referred to in that paragraph, shall be as prescribed by the Minister.”. Pindaan Jadual 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_17__para_a",
