        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (4) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4A) Where subsection (2A) applies, the acquisition price of the real property company as determined under subparagraph 34A(3) of Schedule 2 to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 prior to 1 January 2024 shall be deemed to be the acquisition price of the shares of the relevant company.”; dan"
      }
    },
