        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif “value of its total tangible assets”, dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan “means” perkataan “in relation to the relevant company or another controlled company,”. Pindaan seksyen 34"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6",
