        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan memotong perkataan “and” di hujung perenggan itu;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (d), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan itu dengan perkataan “; and”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i__subpara_C",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "C",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_i",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (d) perenggan yang berikut: “(e) any amount of credit of a Constituent Entity for the Financial Year in respect of a Marketable Transferable Tax Credit that is recorded as a reduction to the current tax expense.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_e__subpara_ii",
