      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen 181(3), dengan menggantikan perkataan “paragraph” dengan perkataan “section”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_k",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "k",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen 192(12);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_l",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "l",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan seksyen 197 dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Transitional relief for the Substance-based Income Exclusion 197. (1) For the purpose of applying subsection 180(4) to a Financial Year beginning in the calendar year of 2025 and subsequent calendar years until the calendar year of 2032, the amount of payroll carve-out for each Financial Year shall be computed according to the following rate: Financial Year beginning in the following calendar year 2025 2026 2027 Financial Year beginning in the Rate following calendar year 2028 9.0% 2029 8.2% 2030 7.4% 2031 6.6% 2032 5.8% (2) For the purpose of applying subsection 180(5) to a Financial Year beginning in the calendar year of 2025 and subsequent calendar years until the calendar year of 2032, the amount of tangible asset carve-out for each Financial Year shall be computed according to the following rate: Financial Year beginning in the Rate following calendar year 2025 7.6% 2026 7.4% 2027 7.2% 2028 7.0% 2029 6.6% 2030 6.2% 2031 5.8% 2032 5.4%”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33__para_m",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "m",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/msa@/~chp_VII__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan 199(1)(a)(iv), dengan menggantikan perkataan “paragraphs” dengan perkataan “subparagraphs”;"
      }
    },
